SSTTAANNDDAARRDDSS
     The iiccoonnvv__ooppeenn(), iiccoonnvv__cclloossee(), and iiccoonnvv() functions conform to IEEE
     Std 1003.1-2008 (“POSIX.1”).

     The iiccoonnvv__ooppeenn__iinnttoo() function is a GNU-specific extension and it is not
     part of any standard, thus its use may break portability.  The ____iiccoonnvv()
     function is an own extension and it is not part of any standard, thus its
     use may break portability.

